{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile RNA-only model, isolating its impact without modality combination. Validation accuracy of 0.6501 suggests stronger performance compared to single-modality baselines (e.g., 0.4849 accuracy in config_002), but the exact contribution of the encoder choice versus other design elements remains uncertain. The trade-off between accuracy and F1 (0.6275) relative to multimodal configurations (e.g., config_007) requires further comparison to isolate encoder effectiveness."
}

